    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Noticing that you seem to be deep in thought, the blonde Construct next to you turns to speak to you."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 202,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "There is not a single mirror in the transport craft's cabin for you to see your own face at the moment."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "You do feel a little different from usual, and it probably has something to do with the fact it's Bianca that you're on the mission with."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "You don't feel edgy, though—in fact, you actually feel excited about where you're headed."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 201,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
